  "final_response": "When installing Git from source on Fedora, RHEL, or RHEL‑derivatives, you must create the symbolic link:\n\n```bash\nsudo ln -s /usr/bin/db2x_docbook2texi /usr/bin/docbook2x-texi\n```\n\nThis is required because the binary name differs on these distributions, ensuring the expected `docbook2x-texi` command is available. [installing.005-installing-from-source]",
